{"3755440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "鸿运修仙传", "steam_appid": 3755440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/extras/326884cdff4bf3d2e3124ccc8566460e.avif?t=1767180009\" width=1364 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a cultivation game. Combining the cultivation system with the traditional Chinese cultural background, experience the process of growing from a mortal to a strong person step by step, and fight against various demons and beasts in the cultivation system. Can you stick to your heart and fight against difficulties; Be cautious in making choices and grasp your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit teammates in the tavern. Interacting with scattered cultivators in the tavern, please have a drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auctions can auction various precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manage your own dojo and build various buildings.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/extras/326884cdff4bf3d2e3124ccc8566460e.avif?t=1767180009\" width=1364 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a cultivation game. Combining the cultivation system with the traditional Chinese cultural background, experience the process of growing from a mortal to a strong person step by step, and fight against various demons and beasts in the cultivation system. Can you stick to your heart and fight against difficulties; Be cautious in making choices and grasp your own destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit teammates in the tavern. Interacting with scattered cultivators in the tavern, please have a drink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auctions can auction various precious resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can manage your own dojo and build various buildings.</p>", "short_description": "A self-propelled AFK game, real-time combat. A groundbreaking treasure, the slot machine treasure increases damage based on sieve points. It is thrown once before each instance and can be enhanced with various gems. Random equipment can be upgraded, and there are also random monsters.,", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/291e6d1979bf5b50c8a8f687774e23fd2b6336c3/header.jpg?t=1767180009", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/0bfd50b3bd17452a6556f321a553b4b796945461/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767180009", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3755440/0bfd50b3bd17452a6556f321a553b4b796945461/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767180009", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["玉米工作室"], "publishers": ["Corn Studio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 599, "final": 599, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$5.99"}, "packages": [1321592], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 鸿运修仙传", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1321592, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "The Legend of Fortune and Immortality - $5.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 599}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux"